---
// MeloMemo · 404
import '../styles/global.css';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN" data-theme="dark">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>走调了 · MeloMemo 404</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b1020" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" />
    <script is:inline>
      try {
        var t = localStorage.getItem('mm-theme');
        if (t) document.documentElement.dataset.theme = t;
        else if (window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: light)').matches) document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'light';
      } catch (e) {}
    </script>
    <style>
      .nf { min-height: 74vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; padding: 40px 22px; }
      .nf .big { font-size: clamp(64px, 14vw, 120px); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1;
        background: var(--gradient); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; }
      .nf h1 { font-size: 22px; margin: 10px 0 6px; }
      .nf p { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 26px; }
      .nf .cta { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav>
      <div class="wrap">
        <a class="logo" href="/">🎶 MeloMemo</a>
        <a class="item" href="/">首页</a>
        <a class="item" href="/app/">社区</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <main class="wrap nf">
      <div class="big" aria-hidden="true">404</div>
      <h1>这段旋律找不到了</h1>
      <p>页面可能已被移动，或者链接打错了一个字符。</p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn primary" href="/">回首页</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="/app/#/feed">去社区听歌</a>
      </div>
    </main>
    <footer class="site"><div class="wrap">© {year} MeloMemo</div></footer>
  </body>
</html>
